ine.js#L85-L176))**: Maps `Name → @Address → Value` across scopes (sharing heap addresses like `@0x2000` when lists are passed into functions) and tracks live `refCount` to filter/dim unreferenced (`0 refs • GC`) heap objects during loops.\n<truncated 936 bytes>\nExpr (F7)` button + interactive reduction chips), **Global vs. Local Scope Isolation Cards**, and **Heap Memory (`@Address → Value`)** panel with the **`Show GC'd`** toggle.\n- [app_build/app.js](file:///C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/code-flow-visualizer/app_build/app.js): Upgraded [`TeachMeCodeApp`](file:///C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/code-flow-visualizer/app_build/app.js#L8-L598) to synchronize line stepping, `F7` sub-expression stepping ([`renderThonnyExpressionStepper`](file:///C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/code-flow-visualizer/app_build/app.js#L379-L418)), isolated scope cards, and heap reference / GC rendering ([`renderArea3MemoryAndScopes`](file:///C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/code-flow-visualizer/app_build/app.js#L423-L553)).\n- [app_build/engine.py](file:///C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/code-flow-visualizer/app_build/engine.py) & [app_build/explainer.py](file:///C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/code-flow-visualizer/app_build/explainer.py): Backend Python tracer and explainer upgraded with [`MemoryHeapTracker`](file:///C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/code-flow-visualizer/app_build/engine.py#L120-L202), [`_build_subexpression_frames_ast`](file:///C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/code-flow-visualizer/app_build/engine.py#L263-L386), and standalone function auto-invocation.\n\n#### 2. Root Runner & Test Scripts\n- [server.py](file:///C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/code-flow-visualizer/server.py): Configured to serve from `app_build/` and import `app_build.engine` and `app_build.explainer`.\n- [test_engine.py](file:///C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/code-flow-visualizer/test_engine.py): Updated to test `