ual, step-by-step format.\n\nInclude:\n\nCurrent execution line.\nStep number and total steps, when known.\nA clear explanation of what happens at this step.\nVariable values before and after the step.\nThe result o\n<truncated 16787 bytes>\nngine.py`) and enrich with `this.explainer.enrichTraceWithExplanations`.\n   3. **Clean up legacy root duplicate files**:\n      - Update [README.md](file:///C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/code-flow-visualizer/README.md) to reflect the clean `app_build/` layout, and clear out the redundant root JS/CSS duplicates (`engine.js`, `explainer.js`, `app.js`, `styles.css`).\n   4. **Respond concisely to the user**:\n      - Confirm that useless/duplicate code has been removed and explain clearly what types of Python & DSA code are supported (and the intentional sandbox security limits like no `import os` or file I/O).\n\n6. **Commitments & Constraints**\n   - Keep responses concise, with clickable `[filename](file:///...)` links.\n   - Do not use external AI APIs.\n   - Do not call `run_command` unless requested by the user.\n</summary>\n\nYou have the 4 following artifacts written to the artifacts directory:\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1791628786466_88bc671a]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/brain/4b927fe1-f9a3-4b3f-9f8a-92760e157eef/.user_uploaded/media_1791628786466_88bc671a.png\nLast Edited: 2026-10-10T10:39:48Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1791630442219_ffbef1d8]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/brain/4b927fe1-f9a3-4b3f-9f8a-92760e157eef/.user_uploaded/media_1791630442219_ffbef1d8.png\nLast Edited: 2026-10-10T11:07:22Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1791630995276_2331d394]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/brain/4b927fe1-f9a3-4b3f-9f8a-92760e157eef/.user_uploaded/media_1791630995276_2331d394.png\nLast Edited: 2026-10-10T11:20:28Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: implementation_plan]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/brain/4b927fe1-f9a3-4b3f-9f8a-92760e157eef/implementation_plan.md\nLast Edited: 2026-10-10T11:28